<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6865"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 9:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There is a &#34;Red Rooster market Ldt.&#34; in Wichita, about 4 blocks south of the phone booth BTK called in the Nancy Fox murder. Is he going to do a drop/murder around there? <BR> <BR>Red Rooster Market Ltd, &#40;316&#41; 262-6881, 520 E Douglas Ave, Wichita, KS 67202   <BR> <BR>here is a map: <BR><a href="http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?ed=MFixkup_0TrouqrksLI.g4kEyxorNZnB2oE-&amp;csz=WICHITA%2BKS%2B67202&amp;country=us&amp;cat=&amp;trf=0" target=_top>http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?ed=MFixkup_0Trou qrksLI.g4kEyxorNZnB2oE-&amp;csz=WICHITA&#43;KS&#43;67202&amp;count ry=us&amp;cat=&amp;trf=0</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
