<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6866"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 9:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks Amandab <BR> <BR>Anything COULD be of value, we have to shoot wide  and somtimes half blind to hit the target in this case IMO, and best case senario; suddenly somone here &#40;or the police who probably read this forum and have MUCH more info avaible&#41; can see a connection between somthing posted here and an individual or other evidence, so keep up the good work.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
