<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7222"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 13, 2005 - 5:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Richerich <BR> <BR>May I ask WHAT IS IT YOU WANT HERE??? what is your mission with your posts?What outcome do you seak with your posting here?  <BR>You are stating that posters here is not precise enough, what about your own message to the forum??? And why do you care so much about what a forum about BTK does? <BR>Please get to the point!make your self clear or leave us alone. Thank you. <BR> <BR>Lilymarie, NO NO problem at all my post was ment for Richerich &#40;or others who once in a while dont like my style<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0>&#41;. <BR> <BR>Bmodule, your so welcome, I´ll always be glad to help if you need it in the future.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
